        "title": "Ability to redact multiple messages",
        "body": "Why would anyone want it to be that hard?\r\n\r\nRiot is currently quite annoying to use because of this. Want to delete 5 messages? You are going to have to click 15 times. 15. It's a joke.\r\n\r\nYou should be able to select multiple messages (or all in a room) then redact them with 3 clicks. \r\n\r\nCan we please make this happen? The Riot UI/UX is currently bad and i would like to see Riot become something worth telling people about.",
