        "updated_at": "2019-08-31 15:35:31",
        "title": "Ability to redact multiple messages",
        "body": "why the fuck is this p3 and open since 2017?\r\n\r\nMajor papercuts in Riot are open since 2y and the team rather implements new features.\r\n\r\nWhere can I post a bug bounty?",
        "comment_id": 526840009,
        "comments": 10,
        "state": "open",
        "closed_at": "1970-01-01 00:00:00",
        "file_time": "2019-08-31 15:00:00",
